Package: specProc
Type: Package
Title: Preprocessing Tools for Laser-Induced Breakdown Spectroscopy (LIBS) Spectra
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christian L.", "Goueguel", , "christian.goueguel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of functions for preprocessing spectra in optical
    emission spectroscopy of laser-induced plasmas, called laser-induced
    breakdown spectroscopy. It covers baseline correction, normalization and
    scaling, orthogonal signal correction and calibration transfer, peak
    fitting, and robust statistics for outlier detection. Computationally
    intensive steps are implemented in C++ for large spectral datasets.
